// Layer_Model_Lifecycle — Model Lifecycle Layer
// Render manual: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture)
// Ekspor PNG ke materials/reports/figures/Layer_Model_Lifecycle.png
// Acuan: subsec:lapisan-model (Subbab IV.4.3, sec:arsitektur-terintegrasi);
//   rincian beralat Model Lifecycle Layer yang memperinci kelompok layanan pada
//   Gambar fig:integrate-service (Subbab IV.2, tanpa alat).
//   Disertakan pada LaTeX sebagai fig:layer-lifecycle.
// Fokus: Feast (fitur training) > Kubeflow Pipelines (orkestrasi training, metadata
//   MySQL) + Katib (tuning); MLflow (tracking + model registry, backend PostgreSQL,
//   artefak MinIO); pemicu drift (Evidently > Prometheus, ambang terlampaui memicu
//   Argo CronWorkflow > retrain Kubeflow Pipelines).
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right): rantai kiri ke kanan, maksimum dua
//   baris node per grup, agar diagram melebar dan muat pada pita
//   height=0.42\textheight. Disertakan tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.
// Landasan layer: label grup membawa kategori sumbernya (najafabadi2024analysis),
//   yaitu ML training ditambah model registry dan ML metadata.
// Verifikasi implementasi: node ada di platform/components/model-lifecycle/
//   (feast, kubeflow-pipelines, kubeflow-katib, kubeflow-notebooks, kubeflow-trainer,
//   mlflow), observability/evidently, observability/kube-prometheus-stack. Argo
//   Workflows/CronWorkflow adalah mesin eksekusi bawaan Kubeflow Pipelines (tanpa
//   direktori komponen mandiri).

direction right

// Sumber fitur (batas)
Layanan Fitur [icon: package, color: green, label: "Layanan Fitur (Feast, Valkey, Qdrant)"]

// Model Lifecycle Layer
Model Lifecycle Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple, label: "Model Lifecycle Layer (ML training + model registry + ML metadata)"] {
  Kubeflow Notebooks [icon: book-open, label: "Kubeflow Notebooks"]
  Kubeflow Pipelines [icon: workflow, label: "Kubeflow Pipelines (orkestrasi training)"]
  Katib [icon: sliders, label: "Katib (HPO)"]
  Kubeflow Trainer [icon: cpu, label: "Kubeflow Trainer"]
  MLflow [icon: package, label: "MLflow (tracking + registry)"]
  Argo Workflows [icon: workflow, label: "Argo Workflows (CronWorkflow)"]
}

// Basis metadata dan artefak (batas)
MySQL [icon: mysql, color: green, label: "MySQL (metadata KFP + Katib)"]
PostgreSQL [icon: postgresql, color: green, label: "PostgreSQL (backend MLflow)"]
MinIO [icon: hard-drive, color: green, label: "MinIO (artefak MLflow)"]

// Pemicu drift dan konsumen (batas)
Evidently [icon: activity, color: teal, label: "Evidently (deteksi drift)"]
Prometheus [icon: prometheus, color: teal, label: "Prometheus (ambang drift)"]
Model Serving Layer [icon: send, color: red, label: "Model Serving Layer (inference)"]

// Alur eksperimen dan training
Layanan Fitur > Kubeflow Pipelines: fitur pelatihan
Kubeflow Notebooks > Kubeflow Pipelines: eksperimen ke pipeline
Kubeflow Pipelines <> Katib: HPO
Kubeflow Pipelines > Kubeflow Trainer: training job
Kubeflow Pipelines > MLflow: log run + registrasi model

// Metadata dan artefak
Kubeflow Pipelines -- MySQL: metadata pipeline
Katib -- MySQL: metadata tuning
MLflow -- PostgreSQL: backend metadata
MLflow -- MinIO: artefak model

// Registri ke serving
MLflow > Model Serving Layer: model dari registry

// Alur retraining otomatis berbasis drift
Model Serving Layer > Evidently: distribusi prediksi
Evidently > Prometheus: metrik drift
Prometheus > Argo Workflows: ambang drift terlampaui
Argo Workflows > Kubeflow Pipelines: retrain otomatis
